# Prettier does not read .gitignore automatically, so build output and
# other generated/tool-owned paths are listed explicitly here.

.next/
out/
build/
coverage/

# drizzle-kit-generated migrations + snapshot JSON must byte-match the
# generator's own output. Reformatting them gets noisily undone on the next
# `db:generate`, so they are excluded rather than fought.
drizzle/

# npm-owned formatting, ~11k lines, not meant for human editing.
package-lock.json

next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# The header block in these files is written and re-inserted by `next dev`
# itself (see the files' own comments). If that tool-generated content
# doesn't match Prettier's markdown output byte-for-byte, `format:check`
# goes red in CI purely because someone ran `next dev` before committing.
# Exclude rather than fight the framework's generator.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
